.nf
YASMV manual                                           validate-progress

validate-progress "FILE" [ -states N ] [ -wall-ms N ] [ -async ]

Rechecks a portable progress proof or counterexample against the loaded model.
Defaults: 10000 states, 30000 ms. Also accepts -conflicts and -propagations.
Target and assumptions come from the artifact. Finite trace replay alone does
not establish a repeating execution or deadlock.
